    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya blessed land has four continents. Three lie on the sea with similar sizes. The fourth and smallest floats in the sky as Cloud Cover Continent. Yellow Hair Continent is one of the three sea continents. In White Hair Continent, Black Hair Continent, and Yellow Hair Continent, city lords usually hold the highest authority and have rank five cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        1049
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
