        "loc_white_hair_continent",
        "loc_black_hair_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Black Hair Continent joins with White Hair Continent against Yellow Hair Continent, and yellow haired captives from those battles are sold as slaves on Black Hair Continent markets.",
      "chapters": [
        1049
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-continent-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hairy men on all three sea continents can see rainbow light from Cloud Cover Continent by raising their heads. After Lang Ya land spirit’s personality changes, he stirs competition among the three continents to select elite candidates to cultivate in Cloud Cover Continent.",
